# ABI 1.6: the sun placed by date, time and place. Solar noon on the
# December solstice at 40 degrees north on the prime meridian (12:00 UTC is
# within two minutes of it). The noon sun stands about 27 degrees high,
# so shadows are long and point north (-Z). Same village and camera as l2_csm_noon.
size 640 360
camera -48 22 46  4 0 -6  60 0.3 400
lighting sun 0.50 35  4 2048 150 0.6 1
sun date 2026-12-21 12:00 0 40 0
clear 0 0 0 1 sky
include _village_items.scene
